#38400
The Solamnic Knight's Guild of Samsera~
The Name of the new Solamnic Guild of Samsera takes the form of a four walled fortress,
or a keep, named Solgaard Keep as suggested by the The knight Zaor. The knights maintain
a large prescence in the City of the Samsera and are responsible for training all the citie's
militia. The Keep itself shall have the following features.
A Drawbridge which enters into the keep.
A Guild Guard that blocks all Non Humans and Non Knights.
2 Shooting Parapets, separated by a single DT. Each Parapet will have a small armory of
bows and arrows that can be used to defend the keep.

A Jousting Range/Battlefield that will be used to determine grand knight.
A Central Courtyard
An Armory
A regen/Chapel with private prayer rooms.
A Training Guildmaster.
A Blacksmith
A SHopkeep

Kurse 10/00'
~
384 1024 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#38401
Solgaard Keep~
   You pass under the large stone gateway to Solgaard Keep, guild to the
Solamnic Knights here in Samsera.  A short drawbridge used to cross the shallow
moat that surrounds the guild is to the south.  The main path to the guild
courtyard bends to the east and north, where many knights train and practice
their skills.    
~
