#38402
The Entrance Tunnel~
   The stone walls curve here as they bend north to the inner courtyard and
southwest to the drawbridge.  Knights on horseback that carry provisions for
the guild, as well as scouts, stand idly about here, awaiting directions from
their commanding officers.  A board used for informing the knights of the
general state of the guild stands here, filled with information.    
