#38403
The Western Parapet~
   You stand at the base of a small guard tower.  The room is circular, made so
by angling thousands of tightly fitted white blocks together.  On the walls lie
equipment racks filled with basic defensive armaments such as shield, light
plate, helmets, and bows.  These items are here to be used in case the Keep is
ever under siege.  A wide ladder leads upwards into the western defensive
parapet.    
~
