#38405
The Western Parapet~
   The top of this short tower is enclosed by a stone roof.  Multiple crossed
slits in the stone wall face outwards, looking over the drawbridge and city
street below.  These 'windows' are used by Solamnic archers to provide
supporting fire and defense to the Keep if so required.  To the south you can
jump off the tower and fall to your death.  Enjoy!    
~
