#38408
Solgaard Armory~
   It is no secret to the outside world that the guild of Solamnic Knights is
incredibly rich.  This massive stone chamber serves as the armory and vault for
the Knights here in Samsera, filled with coffers overflowing with gold coins
and riches, as well as rare weapons, armors, and magical artifacts.  The
knights use these items for the benefit of the guild only, and contribute to
the vault more often than they take from it.    
~
