#38410
Entrance to the Courtyard~
   You now stand in the main courtyard of the keep, where there is always much
activity.  The courtyard is primarily used as a place for training by all three
orders: Crown, Sword, and Rose.  Large warhorses, heavily armored knights with
squires, and provision carts all move throughout the courtyard in a busy
hustle.  To the east you see the door that leads to the Knights place of
worship and rest, the Chapel.  To the west lies the Armory.    
~
