#38411
The Keep Courtyard - Southeast Corner~
   Directly to your east lies the beautiful arched double doors of the Chapel.
Within lies the main rectory and many prayer chambers where knights place their
devotions and pledge their faith in their God.  Further along the inner keep
wall to the north lies the Training chambers as well as the room of the
Kingfisher.  You may also proceed west back towards the courtyard entrance.  

~
