#38412
The Grand Chapel of Faith~
   This room is the center of prayer and faith for the Knights within Solgaard.
Knights sit and kneel in various locations in the large chamber occupied by
their prayers and devotions, an important part of knightly life.  It is the
gods which bestow special powers unto the knight, and neglecting their god will
in turn cause the revocation of these powers.  You feel it would be good to
shed your armor and rest here, taking the time to refresh your body and soul.
~
