#38413
Solamnic Provisions~
   You step through the doorway and into a medium sized stone room stocked full
with supplies to serve the guild.  Bins of breastplates, helmets, greaves, and
gauntlets line the north wall, The east wall is covered in swords, the standard
broadsword by far being the most prevalent.  Tunics, undercoats, and other
dressings hang from racks in the middle of the shop.  Behind a wooden counter
stands Jericho, a squire of Sir Thaniel of the Order of the Sword.    
~
