#38414
The Keep Courtyard - Square of the Sword~
   The sound of swords clashing ring through this part of the courtyard, as
pairs of Knights of the Sword fight one another with sword and shield,
practicing their skills.  The Order of the Sword acts as the guild's army, and
is filled with many knights of renown.  Often Knights will move from the Orders
of the Crown to the Sword, and vice versa.  To the west lies the guild
shopkeeper, where training supplies may be purchased.    
~
