#38415
The Center of the Courtyard~
   You stand now in the direct center of the keep courtyard.  Marking this
place is a ornate mosaic of tiles beneath your feet that form the image of a
beautiful Kingfisher grasping a sword in its talons, the insignia of the
Solamnic Knights.  From here you can go north; where the stables and jousting
plot lie, to the south; where the keep entrance lies, to the east; where the
training chambers and chapel lie, and to the west; where the armory, shop, and
blacksmith are located.    
~
