#38416
The Keep Courtyard - Square of the Crown~
   The sound of a Sargeant Knight of the Crown barking commands to a small
regimen of Knights assaults your ears as you enter this part of the courtyard.
The Order of the Crown is the largest order of the guild, as those of lesser
blood and experience enter.  Knights of the Crown are trained in protection and
ground themselves in their faith.  To the east lies the main training quarters,
where Knights may be schooled in the rudiments of prayer and combat.    
~
