#38417
The Training Room~
   This large room is occupied by knights from all the orders, who have come
here not to just learn the rudiments of their combat training, but new
devotions and prayers to their god.  Being a Knight is no easy task, as they
must follow the strict path of the Oath and Measure.  Any Knight which strays
from these risk being kicked from their order and the knighthood itself.  The
safest practice is to study, pray, and train as often as possible.    
~
