#38418
The Smithy~
   This large metalworker's shop is dominated by three massive anvils, used to
beat and shape weapons.  Next to each anvil lies a cauldron of water for
quenching.  On each wall is a large forge, constantly heated.  The steam and
smoke billow forth into the room, making the heat near unbearable for you.  
Its is here where swords and armor are repaired and created for the guild.    
~
