The Keep Courtyard - Northwest Corner~
   The courtyard is composed of dirt and cobbled stone, worn from steel boots
and shodden hooves.  To the north of here lies the guild stables, where all
work and war horses are kept and cared for.  The shop and armory lie to the
south.  Back on the east side of the keep lie the training halls and chapel.  
