#38420
The Keep Courtyard - Square of the Rose~
   You walk into the northernmost part of the courtyard where a ring of
Knights, all of the Order of the Rose lay kneeled in a prayer.  The Order of
the Rose is that which is steeped the most in tradition and renown in the
guild.  Only those knights of the purest bloodline and greatest experience may
become a Knight of the Rose.  You notice each knight has a long groomed
mustache, and wears a piece of platemail or shield emblazoned by a rose.  To
the north lies the Grand Knight chamber and beyond that, the jousting field.  
Directly south across the courtyard is the exit of the keep.    
~
