#38422
Room of the Kingfisher~
   You step into an officious looking chamber dominated by a massively round
oaken table adorned by the insignia of the knighthood, the kingfisher and
sword.  The white stone walls are adorned by many colorful banners, coats of
arms of some of the oldest and revered bloodlines of the knighthood.  Often,
the lords of all the guild's order gather here to discuss important issues
which affect the guild as a whole.  The room is often spoken of with reverence,
for it is believed to be watched and guarded by the gods themselves.    
~
