#38423
The Stables~
   A long row of stables extends down the wall here, where many horses are kept
and cared for.  Able squires run to and fro carrying hay and water, catering to
the large animals.  The far end of the stable is where saddles, reins, bridles
and other riding accessories are stored.    
~
