Chamber of the Grand Knight~
   You pass under a curved arch and enter a large room adorned with shield and
swords along the stone walls.  It is here where Knights of Honor petition to
hold the title of guild Grand Knight.  Back to the south lies the keep
courtyard, and past the heavy door to the north is the jousting field.    
