#38425
Western end of the field~
   The jousting field comes to an end here as you turn and take a long look all
the way to the other end.  One hundred feet away from here, your steed and
lance will meet your opponent and one of three things will happen: You will be
dismounted, Your opponent will be dismounted, or a lance will break and you
will be forced to joust again.    
You calm your nerves and await the signal to charge the lane.
~
